20
00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:28.050
Carlos Pimenta, Ulisses Gomes, Zé Laviola, Betinho Pinto Coelho, Antônio Carlos Arantes e Noraldino Júnior.

21
00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:37.209
